    <sys:String x:Key="Settings.LaunchHint">Starting the emulator and waiting for it to boot can take a few minutes. A run you stop yourself leaves the game and the emulator open.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Settings.BackKeycodeHint">111 = ESC, 4 = BACK. Check which one acts as "back" in the game.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Settings.Auto">Automatic (faster one)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Settings.Ocr">Use OCR (RapidOCR sidecar in ocr/.venv)</sys:String>
